sequenceDiagram
  %% Contract label: candidate-only; no ProfileModel mirror
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Scan
  participant Flags
  participant Candidate
  participant Review
  participant Secure
  participant Backend
  participant Relaunch
  participant EvidenceCard

  User->>Scan: choose self official AVS response
  Scan->>Flags: check mobile and backend flags
  alt mobile or backend kill switch is false
    Flags-->>Scan: kill-switch rejection, no write
    Scan-->>User: keep AVS amount unavailable
  else both bounded flags are true
    Scan->>Candidate: extract avs_official_pension
    Note over Candidate,Backend: candidate-only, no ProfileModel mirror
    Candidate-->>Review: personal monthly amount + sourceDate + evidenceKind
    Note over Candidate,Review: source=certificate is provenance; evidenceKind preserves epistemic status
    Note over Candidate,Review: no explicit decision/current-statement marker -> official_forecast
    Note over Candidate,Review: official_statement only from explicit current-pension marker
    Review->>Flags: recheck mobile flag before persistence
    alt flag turned off or evidence rejected
      Flags-->>Review: reject and preserve previous durable fact
    else untouched official decision or statement
      Review->>Secure: certificate + official sourceDate + preserved evidenceKind
      Note over Review,Secure: decision / statement: known after review
      Note over Review,Secure: atomic secure envelope {value, source, sourceDate, updatedAt, evidenceKind}
    else untouched official forecast
      Review->>Secure: certificate + official sourceDate + official_forecast
      Note over Review,Secure: forecast: estimated or to verify
    else user corrects amount
      Review->>Secure: correction: userInput + null sourceDate + null evidenceKind
      Note over Review,Secure: atomic secure envelope {value, source, sourceDate, updatedAt, evidenceKind}
    end
    Secure--x Backend: no confirmation value and no backend mirror
    Secure-->>Relaunch: persist then rebuild from durable record
    Relaunch->>Secure: reload strict-secure envelope
    Secure-->>EvidenceCard: self value + source + sourceDate + evidenceKind
    EvidenceCard-->>User: show self evidence only
    Note over Secure,EvidenceCard: full-year entitlement 2026+: monthly x 13
    Note over Secure,EvidenceCard: partial first/final year: effective/claim dates + calendar/pro rata; no blind x12/x13
    Note over Relaunch,EvidenceCard: household calculations stay fail-closed
    Note over Scan,EvidenceCard: target only: no mobile consumer or write-back yet; flags stay off
  end
